ade}_${type.name}\", times.joinToString(\",\")).apply()\n47\t    }\n48\t\n49\t    fun scheduleAlarmsForShift(type: ShiftType, brigade: Int): Int {\n50\t        cancelAlarmsForShiftQuiet(type, brigade)\n51\t\n52\t        prefs.edit()\n53\t            .putBoolean(\"${PreferenceKeys.SHIFT_ALARM_ENABLED_PREFIX}${brigade}_${type.name}\", true)\n54\t            .apply()\n55\t\n56\t        val times = getAlarmTimesForShift(type, brigade)\n57\t\n58\t        times.forEachIndexed { index, timeStr ->\n59\t            scheduleSingleShiftAlarm(\n60\t                type = type,\n61\t                brigade = brigade,\n62\t                index = index,\n63\t                timeStr = timeStr\n64\t            )\n65\t        }\n66\t\n67\t        return times.size\n68\t    }\n69\t\n70\t    fun scheduleSingleShiftAlarm(\n71\t        type: ShiftType,\n72\t        brigade: Int,\n73\t        index: Int,\n74\t        timeStr: String\n75\t    ) {\n76\t        val parts = timeStr.split(\":\")\n77\t        val hour = parts.getOrNull(0)?.toIntOrNull() ?: 6\n78\t        val minute = parts.getOrNull(1)?.toIntOrNull() ?: 0\n79\t\n80\t        var targetDate = LocalDate.now()\n81\t        val nowTime = LocalTime.now()\n82\t        val candidateToday = LocalTime.of(hour, minute)\n83\t\n84\t        if (ShiftSchedule.shiftFor(targetDate, brigade) != type || !candidateToday.isAfter(nowTime)) {\n85\t            targetDate = targetDate.plusDays(1)\n86\t\n87\t            // Ограничиваем поиск 11 днями (10-дневный цикл гарантирует все типы смен)\n88\t            var attempts = 0\n89\t            while (ShiftSchedule.shiftFor(targetDate, brigade) != type && attempts < 11) {\n90\t                targetDate = targetDate.plusDays(1)\n91\t                attempts++\n92\t            }\n93\t        }\n94\t\n95\t        val targetMillis = LocalDateTime.of(\n96\t            targetDate,\n97\t            LocalTime.of(hour, minute)\n98\t        ).atZone(ZoneId.systemDefault())\n99\t            .toInstant()\n100\t   