}\")\n48\t                    }\n49\t            } catch (e: Exception) {\n50\t                cont.resume(\"ОШИБКА: ${e.localizedMessage}\")\n51\t            }\n52\t        }\n53\t    }\n54\t\n55\t    /**\n56\t     * Распознаёт текст из Bitmap.\n57\t     */\n58\t    suspend fun recognizeTextFromBitmap(bitmap: Bitmap): String {\n59\t        return suspendCancellableCoroutine { cont ->\n60\t            try {\n61\t                val image = InputImage.fromBitmap(bitmap, 0)\n62\t                recognizer.process(image)\n63\t                    .addOnSuccessListener { visionText ->\n64\t                        cont.resume(visionText.text)\n65\t                    }\n66\t                    .addOnFailureListener { e ->\n67\t                        cont.resume(\"ОШИБКА: ${e.localizedMessage}\")\n68\t                    }\n69\t            } catch (e: Exception) {\n70\t                cont.resume(\"ОШИБКА: ${e.localizedMessage}\")\n71\t            }\n72\t        }\n73\t    }\n74\t\n75\t    /**\n76\t     * Парсит распознанный текст и извлекает данные для полей зарплаты.\n77\t     * Ищет паттерны вроде \"Норма: 168\", \"Факт: 152\", \"Ночные: 8\" и т.д.\n78\t     */\n79\t    override fun close() {\n80\t        recognizer.close()\n81\t    }\n82\t\n83\t    fun parseSalaryFields(rawText: String): OcrResult {\n84\t        val lines = rawText.lines().map { it.trim() }.filter { it.isNotEmpty() }\n85\t        val foundNumbers = mutableListOf<Pair<String, String>>()\n86\t\n87\t        var normHours: String? = null\n88\t        var factHours: String? = null\n89\t        var nightShifts: String? = null\n90\t        var s4Shifts: String? = null\n91\t        var advanceShifts: String? = null\n92\t        var prazdnHours: String? = null\n93\t\n94\t        // Регулярки для поиска числовых значений\n95\t        val numberPattern = Regex(\"\"\"(\\d+[.,]?\\d*)\"\"\")\n96\t\n97\t        for (line in lines) {\n98\t            val lower = line.lowercase()\n99\t\n100\t            // Норма часов\n101\t            if (normHours == null && (lower.contains(\"норм\") || lower.contains(\"должно\") || lower.contains(\"план\"))) {\n102\t                numberPattern.find(line)?.let {\n103\t                    normHours = it.value.replace(\",\", \".\")\n104\t                    foundNumbers.add(\"Норма часов\" to normHours!!)\n105\t                }\n106\t            }\n107\t\n108\t            // Факт часов\n109\t            if (factHours == null && (lower.contains(\"факт\") || lower.contains(\"отработ\") || lower.contains(\"выполнен\"))) {\n110\t                numberPattern.find(line)?.let {\n111\t                    factHours = it.value.replace(\",\", \".\")\n112\t                    foundNumbers.add(\"Факт часов\" to factHours!!)\n113\t                }\n114\t            }\n115\t\n116\t            // Ночные смены/часы\n117\t            if (nightShifts == null && (lower.contains(\"ночн\") || lower.contains(\"ночь\"))) {\n118\t                numberPattern.find(line)?.let {\n119\t                    nightShifts = it.value.replace(\",\", \".\")\n120\t                    foundNumbers.add(\"Ночные смены\" to nightShifts!!)\n121\t                }\n122\t            }\n123\t\n124\t            // Смены \"с 4\"\n125\t            if (s4Shifts == null && (lower.contains(\"с 4\") || lower.contains(\"с4\") || lower.contains(\"дневн\"))) {\n126\t                numberPattern.find(line)?.let {\n127\t                    s4Shifts = it.value.replace(\",\", \".\")\n128\t                    foundNumbers.add(\"Смены \\\"с 4\\\"\" to s4Shifts!!)\n129\t                }\n130\t            }\n131\t\n132\t            // Аванс\n133\t            if (advanceShifts == null && (lower.contains(\"аванс\") || lower.contains(\"предоплат\"))) {\n134\t                numberPattern.find(line)?.let {\n135\t                    advanceShifts = it.value.replace(\",\", \".\")\n136\t                    foundNumbers.add(\"Смены аванса\" to advanceShifts!!)\n137\t                }\n138\t            }\n139\t\n140\t            // Праздничные\n141\t            if (prazdnHours == null && (lower.contains(\"праздн\") || lower.contains(\"выходн\") || lower.contains(\"нерабоч\"))) {\n142\t                numberPattern.find(line)?.let {\n143\t                    prazdnHours = it.value.replace(\",\", \".\")\n144\t                    foundNumbers.add(\"Праздничные часы\" to prazdnHours!!)\n145\t                }\n146\t            }\n147\t        }\n148\t\n149\t        // Если ничего не нашли по ключевым словам, пробуем извлечь все числа из текста\n150\t        if (foundNumbers.isEmpty()) {\n151\t            val allNumbers = numberPattern.findAll(rawText)\n152\t                .map { it.value.replace(\",\", \".\") }\n153\t                .filter { it.toDoubleOrNull() != null && it.toDouble() > 0 }\n154\t                .take(10)\n155\t                .toList()\n156\t            allNumbers.forEachIndexed { index, num ->\n157\t                foundNumbers.add(\"Число #${index + 1}\" to num)\n158\t            }\n159\t        }\n160\t\n161\t        return OcrResult(\n162\t            normHours = normHours,\n163\t            factHours = factHours,\n164\t            nightShifts = nightShifts,\n165\t            s4Shifts = s4Shifts,\n166\t            advanceShifts = advanceShifts,\n167\t            prazdnHours = prazdnHours,\n168\t            rawText = rawText,\n169\t            recognizedNumbers = foundNumbers\n170\t        )\n171\t    }\n172\t}\n173"
